"icon":"C-CritRate.webp","key":"CritRate","tier":"C","label":"Crit Rate","value":"+10%"},"sub":"WeaknessHit","sub_info":{"icon":"C-WeaknessHit.webp","key":"WeaknessHit","tier":"C","label":"Weakness Hit","value":"+12%"}}]}],"dedicated":{"name":"Guan Yu's Green Dragon Crescent Blade","main_stat":"PATK +247","icon":"GuanYu.webp","a":[{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"},{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"},{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"},{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"}],"b":[{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATKpct.webp"},{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATKpct.webp"},{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATKpct.webp"},{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATKpct.webp"}],"second":"no","why_by_stat":{"DMGAmp":"Increases all damage dealt by Guan Yu by the given %, making it useful for both general damage and higher PVE scores. Also increases DOT damage."},"story":"\"This is a crescent blade bearing the radiant power of the green dragon. With it, you shall command the realm across a thousand leagues.\"\n\nOn a night when the fog of battle had lifted and a cold moonlight settled over the field, Emperor Pascal placed a massive crescent-bladed glaive in Guan Yu's hands. The blade glinted with a cold blue light, as chilling and radiant as a green dragon awaiting its ascent. Guan Yu gave a firm nod, accepting the weapon's weight —and responsibility— with his whole being, igniting his heart with a vow to quell the world of its chaos."},"used_in":[{"tip":"Sudden Raid: Leonid","cat":"pve","banner":"RAID_SUDDEN_LEONID.webp"},{"tip":"Advent Expedition: Kyle","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENT_KYLE.webp"},{"tip":"Tower of Trials","cat":"pve","banner":"TOWER_OF_TRIALS.webp"},{"tip":"Castle Rush: Eileene","cat":"pve","banner":"CR_EILEENE.webp"},{"tip":"Power Up Dungeon: Light","cat":"pve","banner":"PU_DUNGEON_LIGHT.webp"},{"tip":"Adventure (Both)","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENTURE_BOTH.webp"}],"lore":"As the Power of Destruction spread, world officials could no longer control their greed. They squeezed the lifeblood from the people and bandits ran rampant.\nTo protect the powerless commoners, Guan Yu gathered soldiers, and countless men were drawn to him by his character and strength.\nTogether with admirable figures like Zhuge Liang and Zhao Yun, Guan Yu defeated the bandits and brought corrupt officials to justice.\nOver time, his fame grew, and many members of the royal family approached him, hoping to have Guan Yu as their subordinate.\nEach promised him high office and great wealth in exchange for fighting on their behalf.\nHowever, Guan Yu realized that such people would only plunge the world into greater chaos, and he refused all their offers.\nHowever, one day, Guan Yu meets a member of the royal family at Zhuge Liang's request.\nIt was Pascal.\nPascal, instead of offering Guan Yu wealth and honor, offered to create a world where the people could live happily in return for his aid.\nHe accepted and achieved great success in unifying Aisha alongside Pascal, and later, with the support of the people, he was crowned King Muan."}